        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## MiniMax H3 Reel Recreation v2 (Selfism)\n\n1. **Picture 1**: frontal/clear face of the **persona** (Subject 2).\n2. **Picture 2**: 3/4 face + upper body of the **same persona**.\n3. **Video 1**: source reel (24 fps, width 640, frame count = duration). Audio from the reel is used as <Audio 1> **and** exported in the MP4.\n4. **Fixed roles** (do not edit lightly) + **Scene prompt** are concatenated into the R2V prompt.\n5. Defaults: 5 s → 124 frames, **768×1344**, turbo 8-step LoRA @ 0.85, euler / simple 8 steps, INT8 encoder, `ref_image_size = match`.\n\nAko reel nema audio traku, obriši vezu *audio* sa čvora Video 1 (i ka R2V i ka VideoCombine). Bez MiniMax References Manager čvora i bez spoljnog LLM providera za prompt."
      ],
      "title": "Note: Reel Recreation v2"
    }
